.TH DOTFILES 1 "2026-07-27" "dotfiles" "Dotfiles Manual"
.TP
.B list
list modules and their on/off state
.TP
.B enable <name>...
re-enable module(s) (persists)
.TP
.B disable <name>...
disable module(s) (persists)
.TP
.B reload
recompile, then re-exec the current shell
.TP
.B update
git pull --ff-only, then re-run install.sh
.TP
.B update-tools [--with-optional]
install/update tools (aqua + legacy)
.TP
.B apply [--if-needed]
apply $HOME files via chezmoi (alias: stow)
.TP
.B diff
show chezmoi diff vs $HOME
.TP
.B status
show chezmoi managed file status
.TP
.B vnc <cmd> [args]
TigerVNC: start|stop|status|enable|disable
.TP
.B ssh <cmd> [args]
SSH: add|edit|list|sync|migrate
.TP
.B profile <cmd> [args]
local/profile: add|edit|list|init
.TP
.B profile-init
alias for: dotfiles profile init
.TP
.B stow [--if-needed]
alias for: dotfiles apply
.TP
.B jira|gitlab|secrets|bugwarrior|invite
productivity tools
.TP
.B compile
byte-compile zsh framework (.zwc)
.TP
.B doctor
health checks
.TP
.B doctor-tools
tool versions and hooks
.TP
.B validate
configuration integrity
.TP
.B check
lint scripts
.TP
.B audit
secret scan (betterleaks)
.TP
.B test
bats smoke tests
.TP
.B bench [N]
startup benchmark
.TP
.B startup-profile [--sort]
per-module startup timing
.TP
.B doc [man]
regenerate man page
.TP
.B help
show this help
